    <h1>Authentication & <span class="accent">Rate Limiting</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Secure your AI APIs with authentication, implement rate limiting to prevent abuse, and manage usage quotas. Learn JWT tokens, OAuth2, and advanced throttling strategies.</p>
